# 딕셔너리의 마지막 조회 슬롯 캐시와 인덱스 명령으로 넘어가는 MOVE 임시 레지스터 접기가
# 인터프리터와 같은 값을 내야 한다: 같은 키의 has→get→set, 삭제 뒤 재조회, 키 문자열이
# 새로 만들어지는 루프(GC 압박), 배열/딕셔너리가 섞인 컨테이너, 인덱스 키 임시.

func same_key_chain(n) do
  d is {}
  i is 0
  while i < n do
    k is "k" + (i % 10)
    if d.has(k) then
      d[k] is d[k] + i
    else
      d[k] is i
    end
    i is i + 1
  end
  total is 0
  j is 0
  while j < 10 do
    total is total + d["k" + j]
    j is j + 1
  end
  return total
end

func delete_between(n) do
  d is {}
  k is "x"
  d[k] is 1
  hits is 0
  i is 0
  while i < n do
    if d.has(k) then
      hits is hits + d[k]
      d.delete(k)
    else
      d[k] is 2
    end
    i is i + 1
  end
  return hits
end

func rebuild_between(n) do
  d is {}
  k is "anchor"
  d[k] is 7
  acc is 0
  i is 0
  while i < n do
    acc is acc + d[k]
    d["g" + i] is i
    d[k] is d[k] + 1
    i is i + 1
  end
  return acc + d[k]
end

func forward_keys(arr, n) do
  total is 0
  i is 0
  while i < n do
    j is i % arr.len()
    total is total + arr[j] * 2
    arr[j] is arr[j] + 1
    i is i + 1
  end
  return total
end

func make_numdict() do
  d is {}
  d[0] is 1
  d[1] is 2
  d[2] is 3
  d[3] is 4
  return d
end

func mixed_container(arr, d, n) do
  total is 0
  i is 0
  while i < n do
    c is arr
    if i % 2 == 1 then
      c is d
    end
    key is i % 4
    total is total + c[key]
    i is i + 1
  end
  return total
end

func gc_pressure(n) do
  d is {}
  i is 0
  while i < n do
    key is "p" + (i % 50)
    junk is "j" + i + "k" + (i * 3)
    if d.has(key) then
      d[key] is d[key] + 1
    else
      d[key] is 1
    end
    i is i + 1
  end
  return d["p7"] + d.keys().len()
end

r is 0
while r < 40 do
  a is same_key_chain(100)
  b is delete_between(20)
  c is rebuild_between(30)
  e is forward_keys([1, 2, 3, 4], 20)
  f is mixed_container([10, 20, 30, 40], make_numdict(), 20)
  g is gc_pressure(200)
  r is r + 1
end

assert_eq(same_key_chain(1000), 1000 * 999 / 2)
assert_eq(delete_between(10), 5 * 1 + 4 * 2 - 4)
assert_eq(rebuild_between(100), 7 * 100 + 100 * 99 / 2 + 107)
assert_eq(forward_keys([1, 2, 3, 4], 8), 2 * (1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5))
assert_eq(mixed_container([10, 20, 30, 40], make_numdict(), 8), 2 * (10 + 30) + 2 * (2 + 4))
assert_eq(gc_pressure(5000), 100 + 50)

print "jit_dict_cache_forward: PASS"
